coaching_notes_slot_6.body:
- Greeting and vehicle details: every call, keep it
- You name the price and wait. Next week: two times first, price second
- Average this period: {ledger:p06.score_path.1}

- You now ask when they can come: good
- Don't ask, offer: two times, your own words
- Average: {ledger:p06.score_path.2}

- You take the booking when they name a time
- Still no recap. Day, time, job, before you hang up
- Average: {ledger:p06.score_path.3}

- Recap on most calls now; add the address for a new customer
- On 'that's a lot' you sympathise. Answer it: what the price includes
- Average: {ledger:p06.score_path.4}

- Two times before the price, and you take the booking: this is the standard
- A doubt: say what happens if they wait, then offer the time again
- Average: {ledger:p06.score_path.5}
